  "releaseNotes": "Adds ZoHo Desk contact synchronization support.\n      - Adds ContactPatch support for explicit contact field clearing\n      - Adds account-contact mapping models, primary mapping updates, and forbidden lookup handling\n      - Adds sourceId support for contact create and update requests\n      - Adds contact webhook parsing helpers for add, update, and delete events\n      - Improves contact webhook account matching from nested account payloads\n      - Fixes delete-event webhook subscriptions for combined account and contact synchronization",
